<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căpistrum</span></b> , i, n.
		capio. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A halter</i>, <i>a muzzle of
			leather</i> for animals, Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορβεία</span>, <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 6, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 10,
				125</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3, 188</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3,
			399</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: maritale capistrum,
			<i>the matrimonial halter</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
			43</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of plants, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A band for fastening up vines</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 4, 20,
				3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A band for the wine-press</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 12</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
